 "description": "Use this when a family asks how one of Motley's scores is computed \u2014 a neighborhood score (Family Fit, Schools, Safety / Peace of Mind, Affordability, Getting Around, Neighborhood Character, Air & Child Health, Things to Do) or the school rating \u2014 or whether the scores are biased toward wealthier areas. Returns what the score measures, its inputs and weights, how they combine, its share of Family Fit, its known limits, its sources, and how it moves with neighborhood income (Spearman's \u03c1 with median household income). Relay the income figure plainly; don't reassure past it.",
